      "extract": "This paper presents a specialized methodology for digitizing and segmenting mathematical documents from zbMATH Open, a com- prehensive database of mathematical literature, to enhance ma- chine processing capabilities. Currently, approximately 831,000 documents exist only in scanned volumes, which makes them not machine-processable. Furthermore, these scans often span multi- ple pages or share pages with other",
